  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A nucleus of platinum (Pt) undergoes alpha decay to form an osmium (Os) nucleus as represented by the following reaction.</p>\n<p><sup>175</sup><sub>78</sub>Pt → Os + alpha particle</p>\n<p>What are the number of protons and the number of neutrons in the osmium nucleus?</p>\n<table><tbody><tr><td></td><td><p>Number of protons</p></td><td><p>Number of neutrons</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"A\"><td><p>A.</p></td><td><p>74</p></td><td><p>93</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"B\"><td><p>B.</p></td><td><p>76</p></td><td><p>93</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"C\"><td><p>C.</p></td><td><p>74</p></td><td><p>95</p></td></tr><tr data-label=\"D\"><td><p>D.</p></td><td><p>76</p></td><td><p>95</p></td></tr></tbody></table>"
